"""
Parameter Sweep — Rolling Window / Threshold / Stop Loss
=========================================================
Entry/exit hybrid signal:
  Entry (unchanged):
    1. Price rising
    2. MACD(msg_per_min, 12,26,9) crosses above Signal AND MACD > 0
    3. Normalised sentiment > 0 (net bullish)
    4. Price-density correlation >= threshold (optional filter)

  Exit (message-density trailing stop ONLY):
    Track the peak message density (msg_per_min) reached since entry.
    Exit the first window whose msg_per_min falls below
    peak_density * (1 - stop_pct/100).
    MACD cross-down, sentiment<=0, and price-falling no longer close trades
    on their own — they are computed/reported but not used as exits.

Requirements:
    pip install curl_cffi pandas scipy pytz matplotlib

Per-cap fixed windows (when not sweeping window):
  nano  :  60 min
  micro :  60 min
  small : 120 min
  mid   : 120 min
  large : 360 min
  mega  : 360 min

Sweeps:
  threshold    : 0.1 → 1.0  (step 0.1)
  rolling window: 10 → 960  (step 10)
  stop loss    : 10, 20, 30 ... 100%
"""

